                "part_index": null,
                "text": "*   **A True Faint Positive:** If you see a faint, colored line (usually pink or blue, matching the test\u2019s dye) that appears *within* the instructed reading time frame (typically 3 to 5 minutes), you are almost certainly pregnant"
