              "segment": {
                "start_index": 2302,
                "end_index": 2510,
                "part_index": null,
                "text": "Tips for the Most Accurate Result\nTo minimize the chance of a false reading, keep these clinical best practices in mind:\n*   **Use First-Morning Urine:** Your urine is most concentrated when you first wake up"
